WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,100
Mr. Li, I agreed, I agreed, and I didn’t ask anything else.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,020
The core questions to be asked are all clear

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,740
First, clear rights and responsibilities

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,860
Save money by not having to deal with complex capital operations

5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,300
Second, the salary is in line with expectations and benefits are in place.

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,940
Third, here comes my home

7
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,260
It only takes ten minutes to walk

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,500
OK, welcome to join

9
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,900
Lao Zhao will handle the procedures for you.

10
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,820
When can I arrive at work?

11
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,060
Then you can assign tasks now

12
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,660
OK, I'll calculate the overtime pay for you.

13
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,580
The first task is to choose a house for me and tell me your needs.

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:30,530
What is the budget, location and area? I want to live in a villa.

15
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,370
The one with a swimming pool and a garden

16
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:33,290
The environment must be good

17
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:34,730
The garage must be able to park several cars.

18
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:35,770
Not far from the company

19
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,650
Sir, buying and changing a house is not a trivial matter.

20
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,650
From a security perspective

21
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,770
It's best to ask Director Chen first about such a big matter.

22
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:45,560
You have to ask Uncle Chen first to leave Mr. Li.

23
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,200
Then I'll make an alternative plan first.

24
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,440
After you ask for your opinion, I will change it at any time.
